stateDiagram-v2
  IDLE --> TACTIC: start signal HIGH (raw read)
  TACTIC --> SEARCH: opening done
  SEARCH --> ATTACK: opponent front (|bearing| <= 18)
  SEARCH --> FLANK: opponent off-axis (|bearing| > 26)
  ATTACK --> FLANK: |bearing| > 26
  FLANK --> ATTACK: |bearing| <= 18
  ATTACK --> SEARCH: lost >400ms
  FLANK --> SEARCH: lost >400ms
  BACKOFF --> SEARCH: after SIDE_BACKOFF_MS (100ms reverse)
  EVADE --> SEARCH: after escape
  TACTIC --> BACKOFF: side ToF <= 30mm held 150ms
  SEARCH --> BACKOFF: side ToF <= 30mm held 150ms
  ATTACK --> BACKOFF: side ToF <= 30mm held 150ms
  FLANK --> BACKOFF: side ToF <= 30mm held 150ms
  SEARCH --> EVADE: line edge
  ATTACK --> EVADE: line edge
  FLANK --> EVADE: line edge
  BACKOFF --> EVADE: line edge
  TACTIC --> EVADE: line edge
  EVADE --> STOP
  BACKOFF --> STOP
  TACTIC --> STOP
  SEARCH --> STOP
  ATTACK --> STOP
  FLANK --> STOP
  note right of STOP
    Highest priority: checked before every
    other rule, on every loop. Terminal --
    only a power cycle leaves this state.
  end note
  note right of EVADE
    Second priority (line edge). Outranks
    BACKOFF, so the reverse can never back
    the robot over the border.
  end note
